ES:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}En cuanto veas mi casa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡seguro que te vas a poner
a copiar mi estilo!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Dopo che avrai visto casa mia,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
scommetto che non potrai fare
a meno di copiare il mio stile!

Se ti sei pers{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ti conviene
controllare sulla mappa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ehm... io mi oriento malissimo.

{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Oh, no! Che smemorato che sono!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Mi sono dimenticato di portare
qualcosina da mangiare per strada.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Questa è la prima volta che vieni
a casa mia, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Come sono agitato,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
I always have to explain the house
rules to first-time visitors,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Rule number one.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} The food in my
house{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}is not up for grabs!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Actually,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
that's really the only rule.

IT:
Visto che non sei mai stat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} da me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ti illustrerò le regole di casa mia,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Regola numero uno:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}non prendere
niente dal mio frigo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Beh, ecco,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
ho finito. Era l'unica regola!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}You remember my house rules,
right?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hands off the food!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
That's really the only rule.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Recuerdas las reglas de mi casa,
¿no?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡La comida ni tocarla!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
Y esas son todas las reglas.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu te souviens de la règle, hein ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Pas touche à la nourriture !{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
Compris, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ti ricordi il regolamento di casa
mia, no?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Giù le mani dal frigo!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
Fine delle regole.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Egal, wie oft man mich besucht –{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
es wird garantiert nie langweilig!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Also,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} äh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ich wohn ja da und mir
ist nie langweilig bei mir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Why are we going to the ocean?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I don't live on a houseboat,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¿Para qué vamos al océano?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Crees que vivo en un barco,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Perché stiamo andando al mare?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non abito mica in una casa
galleggiante, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Was wollen wir denn am Meer?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich wohn doch nicht auf einem
Hausboot, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bien.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Alors on ne perd plus de
temps, on y va tout de suite, OK,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ah ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu as des emplettes à faire ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tu préférerais peut-être venir chez
moi une autre fois ?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Non, on va chez toi.
Une autre fois.

EN:
Oh, OK.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Well, that's too bad.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
But we can get together some other
time.

ES:
Ah, vale.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Bueno, es una lástima.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pero ya quedaremos si eso
en otra ocasión.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Bekle!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Benden niye kaçıyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Peşinden koşunca acıktım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Karnım zil çalıyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Takılacak enerjim
